      "settings": {
        "back_text": "Back",
        "custom_title": "Round Air-Lift Stool w/ Backrest - 31200",
        "intro_highlight": "Crafted for professional aesthetic environments, the Round Air-Lift Stool with Backrest 31200 provides enhanced lumbar support and reliable mobility, prioritizing practitioner ergonomics and uncompromising stability. Designed for intensive daily use, this stool features an adjustable ergonomic backrest to reduce spinal fatigue during prolonged treatment sessions.",
        "custom_description": "<p>The Round Air-Lift Stool 31200 is purpose-built for licensed professionals, including Estheticians, Clinical Spa Technicians, and Massage Therapists. Its pneumatic height adjustment ranges smoothly from 20.5\" to 27.5\", adapting effortlessly to all workstations and treatment tables. Featuring an adjustable ergonomic backrest, ultra-resistant leatherette, and ultra-quiet casters, it ensures secure stability and frictionless 360-degree mobility throughout demanding schedules.</p>",
        "subtitle": "Ergonomic Adjustable Backrest & Pneumatic Air-Lift",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Unrivaled durability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the aesthetic quality and structural integrity of the 31200 Stool, perform regular sanitation with non-abrasive products formulated for professional environments weekly. The heavy-duty stain-resistant base and premium vinyl upholstery ensure an as-new professional appearance across years of heavy usage.</p>",
        "show_variant_selectors": true,
        "show_color_option": true,
        "show_size_option": false,
        "featured_product": "round-air-lift-stool-31200",
        "btn_label": "ADD TO CART",
